        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 American Society for Bariatric Surgery. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "The sarcoidosis patient who seeks surgical management for obesity presents many challenges. The interaction between sarcoidosis and obesity complicates both disorders and creates special issues to consider when contemplating surgery. This manuscript will review the approach to pre- and postoperative management of the sarcoidosis patient undergoing bariatric surgery."
      },
